[settingsui]
bossphysicssection=Boss Physics
bossphysicsenabled=Enable Boss Physics
bossphysicsserverhint=These are server settings: they can only be changed from the main menu, and in multiplayer the server's settings apply to everyone. In a world, admins can edit the file and use /bp reload.
bossphysicsattackssection=Walls and boss attacks
bossphysicsblockprojectiles=Walls stop listed boss projectiles
bossphysicsprojectilesbreakwalls=Those projectiles damage the walls they hit
bossphysicsexplosionsbreakwalls=Listed boss explosions damage objects
bossphysicssummonsbreakwalls=Boss summons break doors and walls to reach you
bossphysicsdamageinsettlements=Also damage walls inside settlements
bossphysicsdamagesection=Wall damage
bossphysicswalldamagepercent=Projectile wall damage (% of the projectile's damage)
bossphysicsmaxwallfractionpercent=Most a single projectile can take off a wall (% of its health)
bossphysicsexplosiondamagepercent=Explosion damage to objects (% of the explosion's damage)
bossphysicssummondoorhits=Summon hits that break a door (0 = vanilla damage only)
bossphysicssummondamagepercent=Summon wall damage per hit (% of 10)
bossphysicsfilehint=Which bosses, projectiles, explosions and summons are affected, boss tool tiers and breakable object types are in cfg/mods/a632079.bossphysics.cfg. Test balance changes with the balance test before using them.
